        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This massive elephant-like creature is covered in long, coarse hair, and its tusk sweep upward in great curves of yellowed ivory.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 8, flat-footed 21 (+13 natural, -2 size)</p><p>hp 154 (13d10+91)</p><p>Fort +14, Ref +8, Will +7</p><p>Resist Ice 15</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft.</p><p>Melee Gore +23 (2d6+11), Slam +23 (1d8+11), 2 Stomps +21 (2d6+5)</p><p>Space 15 ft.; Reach 15 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Snowstorm, Trample (1d8+16, DC 27)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 33, Dex 10, Con 23, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +26 (+28 bull rush); CMD 36 (38 vs bull rush; 40 vs trip)</p><p>Feats Improved Bull Rush, Iron Will, Multiattack, Toughness, Weapon Focus (slam), Weapon Focus (stomp), Weapon Focus (gore)</p><p>Skills Perception +17</p>"
